"gap-1 inline-flex items-center border border-solid font-bold has-[svg:only-child]:px-0 transition disabled:pointer-events-none focus-visible:outline disabled:opacity-50 justify-center bg-background rounded-full text-text h-8 min-w-8 px-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-[1.125rem] text-subtext1 hover:bg-mix-current hover:bg-mix-amount-10 active:bg-mix-current active:bg-mix-amount-15 focus-visible:bg-mix-current focus-visible:bg-mix-amount-10 outline-current -my-2 size-8 min-w-8 shrink-0 border-transparent bg-transparent p-0 text-gray-700 hover:bg-blue-500/10 hover:text-blue-500 focus-visible:outline-blue-500" aria-label="More" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" data-icon="icon-more" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" display="flex" role="img" class="size-[18px]"><path d="M3 12c0-1.1.9-2 2-2s2 .9 2 2-.9 2-2 2-2-.9-2-2zm9 2c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2s-.9-2-2-2-2 .9-2 2 .9 2 2 2zm7 0c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2s-.9-2-2-2-2 .9-2 2 .9 2 2 2z"></path></svg></button></div></div><div dir="auto" class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-text text-body font-normal"><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-normal">Our hearts are with everyone affected by the earthquakes in Venezuela.

Our nonprofit, </span><a rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-brand text-[length:inherit] font-normal hover:underline" href="http://Airbnb.org" target="_blank">Airbnb.org</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-normal"> is providing free, emergency housing to critical workers for a number of its nonprofit partners.

