svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" data-icon="icon-more" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" display="flex" role="img" class="size-[18px]"><path d="M3 12c0-1.1.9-2 2-2s2 .9 2 2-.9 2-2 2-2-.9-2-2zm9 2c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2s-.9-2-2-2-2 .9-2 2 .9 2 2 2zm7 0c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2s-.9-2-2-2-2 .9-2 2 .9 2 2 2z"></path></svg></button></div></div><div dir="auto" class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-text text-body font-normal"><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-normal">Nuestros pensamientos están con todos los afectados por los terremotos en Venezuela.

Nuestra organización sin fines de lucro, </span><a rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-brand text-[length:inherit] font-normal hover:underline" href="http://Airbnb.org" target="_blank">Airbnb.org</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-normal">, está proporcionando alojamiento de emergencia gratuito a trabajadores esenciales para varios de sus socios sin fines de lucro.</span><button type="button" class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-blue-500 text-[length:inherit] font-normal"> Show more</button></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 empty:hidden"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><a class="border-border bg-gray-0 block cursor-pointer overflow-hidden rounded-md border" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://t.co/AlJ3K70h6Y" target="_blank"><div class="relative w-full overflow-hidden" style="aspect-ratio:1200 / 675"><img class="h-full w-full object-cover" height="675" loading="lazy" width="1200" alt="" src="https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2071717805179670528/E83Q3LmK?format=jpg&amp;name=orig"/><div class="absolute start-3 end-3 bottom-3"><div class="inline-flex h-5 max-w-full items-center rounded-xs bg-black/75 px-2"><div class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-text line-clamp-1 text-subtext2 font-normal [text-overflow:ellipsis] text-white">Airbnb.org | Emergency housing for displaced families and first responders</div></div></div></div></a><a class="block w-fit" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://t.co/AlJ3K70h6Y" target="_blank"><div class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-gray-700 line-clamp-1 text-subtext2 font-normal">From airbnb.org</div></a></div></div><div class="@container -ml-0.5 flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-1"><div class="inline-flex items-center transition min-w-0 flex-1 text-gray-700"><span class="group inline-flex items-center